<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe Oct M3 money supply grows 11.75 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe Oct M3 money supply grows 11.75 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's year-on-year broadly defined M3 money supply grew 11.75 percent in October after a rise of 33.78 percent in September, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>(Z$million)	Oct 1996    Sept 1996   Oct 1995</p>
<p>M3		   19,487.8    21,915.3    17,438.7</p>
<p>M2		   17,941.5    20,776.6    15,989.3</p>
<p>M1		   12,041.0    14,220.6    11,188.1</p>
<p>-- Harare Newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9</p>
</text>
